                            <span class="bl-gov-rule-code">CORE-008</span>
                            <span class="bl-gov-rule-desc">TDD mandatory — write failing test first, then implement. No exceptions.</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bl-gov-rule">
                            <span class="bl-gov-rule-code">CORE-028</span>
                            <span class="bl-gov-rule-desc">File naming: snake_case only — enforced on every new file created</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bl-gov-rule">
                            <span class="bl-gov-rule-code">CORE-048</span>
                            <span class="bl-gov-rule-desc">Holistic validation gate before IMPLEMENT/FIX/REFACTOR — no skipping</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bl-gov-rule">
                            <span class="bl-gov-rule-code">CORE-064</span>
                            <span class="bl-gov-rule-desc">Sweep Completeness — every audit exhausts its full issue catalogue</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bl-gov-rule">
                            <span class="bl-gov-rule-code">CORE-068</span>
